> Ollamaplate: start the Ollama server, choose a model, see what is
> loaded and chat. Needs `ollama` and python3 (chat.py uses only the
> standard library).
>
>   termplate run examples/ollamaplate/app.termplate

app OLLAMAPLATE
- termplate 0.1
- layout MAIN
- language en

include ui/*
include text/*
